3. Summon is the verb in ordinary use; summons should not be used as a verb except in the special sense to serve with a legal summons or issue a summons against, & even in that sense summon is equally good.
===
3. *Summon* is the verb in ordinary use; *summons* should not be used as a verb except in the special sense *to serve with a legal summons or issue a summons against,* & even in that sense *summon* is equally good.
>>>

